Cell["\<\
Dropping the far vertex breaks inextensibility, so the truncation is no \
longer a ray.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"a9fd734e-f6ec-4038-8373-f80e84d164af"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
